/*
 * EmitExpr.h.ct - the body writer: kind dispatchers and their slices
 * (SH-94 S1a-1 Phase D6, completed by the v1-PH-2 S8 tail).
 *
 * `emit_expr` / `emit_node` / `emit_field` / `emit_inline` / `emit_outconv`
 * and the `em_expr_*` / `em_node_*` / `em_inline_*` / `em_field_*` slices
 * moved here, together with the owning-handle bookkeeping (`StrRetain` /
 * `g_sb`), the match-arm / `EmitBuf` helpers and the type-substitution /
 * overload-suffix helpers. Every body is byte-identical to the one
 * Emitter.h.ct held; the `Emitter` type and the `EmitExpr` declarations live
 * in EmitterCore.h.ct, so this unit imports Core and the sibling emit units,
 * and the import graph stays acyclic.
 *
 * `EmitDecl` (concrete impls / declarations) and `EmitShell` import this unit
 * for the shared helpers; this unit never imports them.
 *
 * License: same as the rest of the compiler (see LICENSE / LICENSE.EXCEPTION).
 */

